# Court witness (2026-10-01 consolidation). Positive fixture: a candidate carrying the complete reversible-option contract.
@prefix dfcm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/dfcm#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
dfcm:CandidateWitness a dfcm:Candidate ; dfcm:slug "witness" ; dfcm:family "witness" ; dfcm:standing dfcm:UNKNOWN ; dfcm:assumption "a" ; dfcm:falsifier "f" ; dfcm:ctqNovelty 1 ; dfcm:ctqEvidence 1 ; dfcm:ctqReversibility 1 ; dfcm:rollbackCost 1 ; dfcm:uncertainty 1 ; dfcm:requiresReceipt true ; dfcm:authority dfcm:SELECT .
